# Cyclops_ResetBeamFlicker: the corpus never runs it (Cyclops_ResetBeams calls it at the end of a
# scene with CYCLOPS's beam). One case at the first top-level call of any function, with the flicker
# state as it is while a beam's sprite group flickers: an update pending, the splice on, and a
# splice {first slot - 1, first slot, record byte, enable} both new and current. Both versions must
# leave $FFE98E-$FFE997 zero and touch nothing else.
at any
case beam_flickering
w $FFE98E = $0101
l $FFE990 = $0F100301
l $FFE994 = $0F100301
